WEBVTT

00:04:27.805 --> 00:04:31.642
The US broke many of its promises 
with Indigenous nations

00:04:31.642 --> 00:04:33.853
making issues like this common.

00:04:34.145 --> 00:04:37.523
Native people have been fighting
for broken treaties to be honoured

00:04:37.523 --> 00:04:38.774
for generations,

00:04:38.941 --> 00:04:41.694
achieving some major victories 
along the way.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.238
Meanwhile, if untouched,

00:04:44.238 --> 00:04:47.533
the faces engraved 
on the Six Grandfathers Mountain

00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:51.579
are expected to remain 
for thousands of years to come.